Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:23.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}French Open finalist, Wimbledon finalist, US Open champion — and now your 2026 Junior Finals champion!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N法网亚军 温网亚军 美网冠军\N现在是成都总决赛的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.53,0:00:29.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Sun shines in Chengdu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阳光 照耀成都
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:39.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun Xinran: 40 and 3 on this 2026 season at the junior level.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个赛季 她四十胜三负
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:42.02,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}场球 她只丢了一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.58,0:00:45.56,TL,,0,0,0,,首战 她一度{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:47.56,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:49.69,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然叫了医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.69,0:00:53.33,TL,,0,0,0,,右膝缠上绷带 她重新站回底线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.89,TL,,0,0,0,,暂停回来 她连破带保追平比分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:00:59.48,TL,,0,0,0,,又把第一盘拖进了抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:10.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Both service points from Cvetkovic in this tiebreak go the way of her opponent.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N抢七她的两个发球分\N又都送给了对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.03,0:01:20.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You can see her way to victory in this first set now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她离拿下首盘不远了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.13,0:01:34.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The player is staying fairly central there — the tape from behind the baseline,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N球员站位保持居中\N球擦网带而过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.13,0:01:39.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it is match point for Xinran Sun.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是孙心然的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.13,0:01:49.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's got two of them, and executes on the first.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两个赛点 第一个就兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:56.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match to Xinran Sun, 7-6, 6-2,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束\N孙心然七比六 六比二获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:02:12.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}she might have scarcely believed it — receiving treatment on her right knee, three games to one down{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她接受理疗时大概也没想到\N当时她一比三落后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:21.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}From there she roared back — two games down at the beginning of the second set as well{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从那里她一路反扑\N第二盘开局也曾两局落后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:28.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it looked like Cvetkovic might mount a comeback{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对手一度看似要反扑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:40.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun would once again rally and win six consecutive games to take her opening match{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她再次连赢六局\N拿下首战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:44.06,TL,,0,0,0,,第二场 只用了{\fs78}50{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:46.24,TL,,0,0,0,,再遇普什卡列娃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.58,TL,,0,0,0,,温网决赛赢她的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:51.61,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 孙心然没有给她机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:56.48,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.48,0:02:59.69,TL,,0,0,0,,来到赛点局 她已经连赢{\fs78}7{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:06.19,TL,,0,0,0,,第一个赛点 她直接拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.19,0:03:09.01,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}50{\fs68}分钟 小组赛两连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:14.44,TL,,0,0,0,,末轮 她打得最从容
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:17.62,TL,,0,0,0,,对埃弗雷莫娃 她一上来就压着节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.62,0:03:20.63,TL,,0,0,0,,正手抢攻 第一盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:25.38,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘她一度{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.38,0:03:29.21,TL,,0,0,0,,连扳{\fs78}3{\fs68}局 破发之后{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:35.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Match point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.23,0:03:47.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This crowd in Chengdu got exactly what they came to see{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N成都观众\N等到了想看的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.73,0:03:51.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Undefeated in round robin play.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N小组赛全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:56.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She moves to 3-1 in her career against the former world junior number one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她与埃弗雷莫娃的交手记录\N来到三胜一负
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:04:00.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The 16-year-old from China — 6-1, 6-4.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十六岁的中国姑娘\N六比一 六比四
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:04.20,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 她更快了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:06.46,TL,,0,0,0,,对{\fs78}2{\fs68}号种子科瓦科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.46,0:04:09.20,TL,,0,0,0,,她开局就回破 {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:12.36,TL,,0,0,0,,节奏 从一开始就在她手里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:16.14,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 只用了不到半小时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:20.62,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 她的发球胜赛局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:23.71,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}48{\fs68}分钟 她不想再多等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:30.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's just been so sound.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的发挥太稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:35.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Too many of those forehands sailing along.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对手的正手频频出界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:43.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun continues to test that wing — and now she's got two match points.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她继续压制那一侧\N拿到了两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:26.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}One of the best junior seasons we have seen in the 21st century.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是二十一世纪\N最好的青少年赛季之一
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:33.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's played eight junior events — into her seventh final of the season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N八站比赛\N第七次打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:41.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Champion at the US Open, finalist at Wimbledon, finalist at Roland Garros.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N美网冠军 温网亚军 法网亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.03,0:05:45.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Now a finalist at the Junior Finals in Chengdu as well.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N如今又打进成都总决赛的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.03,0:05:51.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The second Chinese player to ever have the opportunity to play for the title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二位有机会\N打进这项决赛的中国球员
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:56.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Tip of the cap to world number two, Jana Kovackova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N向世界第二科瓦科娃致意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.18,0:06:00.11,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 又是普什卡列娃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:01.88,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:05.65,TL,,0,0,0,,她在对方的发球局动手 破发 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:11.49,TL,,0,0,0,,发球胜盘局 她没有手软
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.99,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 第一盘拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:34.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And so it's a set point fought off, a bullet dodged.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N盘点救回来了\N躲过一劫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:41.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just didn't do enough with the drop shot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N吊小球的火候 还差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.53,0:06:45.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What an approach from Pushkareva.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N普什卡列娃这拍上网 时机抓得准
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.63,0:06:48.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Depth, angle.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N深度 角度都有了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.43,0:07:07.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And now the lead's extended to 4-1.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N领先扩大到四比一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:48.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wow — Sun Xinran has yet to drop a set this tournament.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周 她还没有丢过一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:59.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}First tiebreak in the five career head-to-head matchups between these two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N五次交手里的第一个抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.43,0:08:09.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Could tell that was the do-or-die point for Sun Xinran.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看得出 这是她的生死分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:11.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just full acceleration.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她全速出击
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.23,0:08:20.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Does it provide a spark to turn around this tiebreak?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这会是翻盘的火花吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.93,0:08:42.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh my goodness.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:09:00.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Drop shot successful — four set points to send us to a decider.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N吊小球得手\N四个盘点 决胜盘在招手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:56.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两个盘点 都救回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:47.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, misses it wide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍 打出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:50.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A deciding set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛进入决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:55.38,TL,,0,0,0,,温网决赛 她先赢一盘被逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:58.13,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 第三盘她连保带破
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:01.98,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}开局 剧本 自己改了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.93,0:11:25.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It feels like a match point, doesn't it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这感觉 就像是一个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.23,0:11:34.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So hard to sustain the degree of attacking tennis it requires to hit through Sun Xinran.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N想持续打出能打穿她的进攻 太难了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:45.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You just wonder if the gas tank's on empty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的油箱 怕是已经见底了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:52.78,TL,,0,0,0,,第三盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 冠军只剩最后一局
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:56.03,TL,,0,0,0,,她走向发球线 深吸一口气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:10.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No, you're kidding.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:23.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Like I said, she's inevitable.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我说过 她势不可挡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:13:08.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So much to celebrate for Anna Pushkareva: junior Wimbledon champion, US Open finalist, and over $18,000 in travel grants.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N普什卡列娃同样值得庆祝\N温网冠军 美网亚军\N还有一万八千美元资助
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:22.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The story of the 2026 junior calendar is what Sun Xinran has accomplished.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二〇二六青少年赛季的故事\N就是孙心然写下的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:43.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}French Open finalist, Wimbledon finalist, US Open champion — and now your 2026 Junior Finals champion!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N法网亚军 温网亚军 美网冠军\N现在是成都总决赛的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:49.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Sun shines in Chengdu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阳光 照耀成都
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:59.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun Xinran: 40 and 3 on this 2026 season at the junior level.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个赛季 她四十胜三负
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.73,0:14:08.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Eight events, seven finals, and another crown to her name.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N八站比赛 七进决赛 又一冠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.23,0:14:20.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I played the whole match according to my game plan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N整场比赛按照战术来执行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:27.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Anna played really well today, too.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安娜打得也非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:35.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I just kept telling myself: don't give up, hang in there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我就想着不要放弃 坚持下来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:42.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Play my best tennis no matter what. I believed I could do it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N无论怎样打出自己最好的网球\N我相信我一定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:47.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I also want to say something to Anna.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我也想对安娜说几句
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:52.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We play each other four times this year. I cannot believe it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今年我们交手了四次 不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.73,0:14:58.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I hope I don't see you next year — but you're an amazing player.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N希望明年别再碰到你 你太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:02.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I like to play with you, and we are really good friends.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我喜欢和你打球 我们是好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:05.45,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 不要放弃坚持下来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.45,0:15:07.54,TL,,0,0,0,,我相信我一定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:11.08,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁 五战全胜 年终世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:13.43,TL,,0,0,0,,下一站广州 成人赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:15.83,TL,,0,0,0,,她能把这股劲带到哪儿？
